      "source_sha256": "b8c69b826e3ed31a",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-07",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "any [?] in Israel [?]"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.34.s28",
      "source_sha256": "26d3e06cd324c35b",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-09",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "a kingdom"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.34.s29",
      "source_sha256": "2819208e3c8c17ea",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-09",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Cyrus"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.34.s30",
      "source_sha256": "8bcad29ebab82cb1",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-09",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "named"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.34.s31",
      "source_sha256": "57738c791d83df70",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-07",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "If, then, anyone believes that by Cyrus, king of the Persians,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.34.s32",
      "source_sha256": "b3f9c352c3c2859a",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-09",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "[as] was foretold. Let him recognize that it is contrary [to reason] and heathenish for any man to believe"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.34.s33",
      "source_sha256": "9fddd5d7723ec1a6",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-09",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "that that godless man"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.34.s34",
      "source_sha256": "72864b8c005ac8b8",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-02",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "and the heathen"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.34.s35",
      "source_sha256": "be1aeccb86002aca",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-02",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "to idols"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.34.s36",
      "source_sha256": "ef21c00ec78afeb9",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-02",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "worshipper should be called Christ,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.34.s37",
      "source_sha256": "93c65ec59f740c02",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-02",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "God and Lord"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.34.s38",
      "source_sha256": "8122bf799318fead",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-09",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "was so named. Moreover, about this it is not"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.34.s39",
      "source_sha256": "2fbcf218c5fd42a2",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-09",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "written thus in the translation of the Seventy,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.34.s40",
      "source_sha256": "3d580c7dabfaa893",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-09",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "\"to my Christ Cyrus\";"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.34.s41",
      "source_sha256": "d1916467b7b4da5d",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-09",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "rather, they wrote"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.34.s42",
      "source_sha256": "f276ba5275eac226",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-07",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "\"This said the Lord"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.34.s43",
      "source_sha256": "3331607e7596450a",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-09",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "\"to my Christ the Lord,\" and that is"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.34.s44",
      "source_sha256": "6685a3f70a224316",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-07",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "now undoubtedly clear"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.34.s45",
      "source_sha256": "a1ef11b44dc76f7f",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-07",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "to understand"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.34.s46",
      "source_sha256": "c38f30151e42d4fe",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-02",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "that this is said in"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.34.s47",
      "source_sha256": "4a91c0aa8d42d2e3",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-07",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "as the name of our Lord. If Christ is not God,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.34.s48",
      "source_sha256": "8e843ff5854327dc",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-02",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "let the unbelievers now tell us"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.34.s49",
      "source_sha256": "1160725cf25342f3",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-09",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "to whom God was speaking."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.34.s50",
      "source_sha256": "bd60b12345bdf319",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-02",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "in Genesis, where"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.34.s51",
      "source_sha256": "81ce7dd506479a96",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-09",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "…he said:"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.34.s52",
      "source_sha256": "72a2cec35f8e835f",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-07",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "\"Let us make man"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.34.s53",
      "source_sha256": "04cfb4fd94ddfb61",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-09",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "…to our image and in our likeness. So it is also said afterwards: And God created man to the image and likeness."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.34.s54",
      "source_sha256": "6e041b8b393ab8d6",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-07",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "of God,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.34.s55",
      "source_sha256": "3c2ad5fff629b447",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-07",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "he made him.\""
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.34.s56",
      "source_sha256": "6e35b8cfa188f5ea",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-09",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Let us ask"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.34.s57",
      "source_sha256": "035721f91d58d7d7",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-09",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "then, now: which God created,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.34.s58",
      "source_sha256": "0ddf74f9167af598",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-09",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "or in whose"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.34.s59",
      "source_sha256": "f90c50137b8077be",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-09",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "godhead"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.34.s60",
      "source_sha256": "328e1d09e98270d6",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-07",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "he made man in the image,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.34.s61",
      "source_sha256": "3f03201618082101",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-07",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "him."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.34.s62",
      "source_sha256": "3a9b630cceeb8545",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-02",
      "group_size": 21,
      "text": "he"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.34.s63",
      "source_sha256": "38ef99c3b18307d1",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-02",
      "group_size": 24,
      "text": "created. If they answer and say: \"in that of the angels,\""
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.34.s64",
      "source_sha256": "229dbb89acc73c39",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-02",
      "group_size": 24,
      "text": "yet an angel is not equally like God."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.35.s1",
      "source_sha256": "080f25469e8a4bd0",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-07",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "[?] hand over them,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.35.s2",
      "source_sha256": "b2aefffbe01fc9e5",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-07",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "and they will become plunder for those who previously served them."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.35.s3",
      "source_sha256": "0b26dcc17ab0a78f",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-09",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "and you shall know that the Lord of hosts sent me. Well now, whose, then, can"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.35.s4",
      "source_sha256": "d26b36e648505bf5",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-09",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "this voice"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.35.s5",
      "source_sha256": "013b5e1fbfe50dda",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-07",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "to be, unless [?]"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.35.s6",
      "source_sha256": "ba59b50a944841a1",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-07",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "of the Savior"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.35.s7",
      "source_sha256": "7f7e32d08be68f40",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-09",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "of the Lord be, who, almighty God, declared himself to be sent from the almighty Father? So he was certainly sent to the peoples, according to the glory of his godhead, which he together [?]"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.35.s8",
      "source_sha256": "4b980b75d546d739",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-02",
      "group_size": 24,
      "text": "with the Father,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.35.s9",
      "source_sha256": "dd149c450e1b79ef",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-09",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "When he emptied himself and [took on the form] of a servant"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.35.s10",
      "source_sha256": "2d663a8b37590738",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-09",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "form"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.35.s11",
      "source_sha256": "48912e5c441b410f",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-07",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "took on"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.35.s12",
      "source_sha256": "c3a0640c4361313a",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-09",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "became obedient"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.35.s13",
      "source_sha256": "a17a5ff535509187",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-02",
      "group_size": 24,
      "text": "unto death."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.35.s14",
      "source_sha256": "68494321e829d62d",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-07",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "The same one also"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.35.s15",
      "source_sha256": "0641d1c5d2d4cd42",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-09",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Following this he said: Praise and rejoice,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.35.s16",
      "source_sha256": "11f759f398c6a93e",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-09",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "daughter of Zion, for behold, I come"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.35.s17",
      "source_sha256": "3c9bd42bdcf0e175",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-02",
      "group_size": 24,
      "text": "and in your midst"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.35.s18",
      "source_sha256": "3f6f3b80529f3753",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-09",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "[and I will] dwell, says the Lord,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.35.s19",
      "source_sha256": "101f92bf16263a2e",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-02",
      "group_size": 24,
      "text": "And on that day"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.35.s20",
      "source_sha256": "c1f0916ebff392c2",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-07",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "many nations will be gathered"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.35.s21",
      "source_sha256": "d4058bee35a8d624",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-07",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "to the Lord"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.35.s22",
      "source_sha256": "543f84a1fe6c8574",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-07",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "and they will become my people"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.35.s23",
      "source_sha256": "4a0c9fe1e5d40c7f",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-09",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "and I will dwell in your midst."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.35.s24",
      "source_sha256": "0d976075350b1229",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-09",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "And you shall know"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.35.s25",
      "source_sha256": "d5e23bbce491f291",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-09",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "that the Lord of hosts sent me to you."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.35.s26",
      "source_sha256": "b24396f9f2b8aea8",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-09",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Who is"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.35.s27",
      "source_sha256": "308a6ac9df8c9807",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-09",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "then, now, this Lord, from the Lord of hosts"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.35.s28",
      "source_sha256": "bfc8bf60992a7c31",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-09",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "sent"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.35.s29",
      "source_sha256": "1994fdd6b11f8ae0",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-07",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "unless, again, the same Lord, the Savior Christ? Moreover, he is also"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.35.s30",
      "source_sha256": "9d65d42b6a9ba358",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-07",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "before"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.35.s31",
      "source_sha256": "845b795906e6ae14",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-07",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "from the Holy Spirit"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.35.s32",
      "source_sha256": "122665f05727ec95",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-07",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "of whose divinity"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.35.s33",
      "source_sha256": "51c08d9014b9d1ed",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-02",
      "group_size": 21,
      "text": "and that"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.35.s34",
      "source_sha256": "3a9b630cceeb8545",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-02",
      "group_size": 21,
      "text": "he"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.35.s35",
      "source_sha256": "517fa26fb389ea25",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-07",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "is the Spirit of God, as he said"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.35.s36",
      "source_sha256": "6f025e770b8b49c7",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-07",
      "group_size": 24,
      "text": "Job:"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.35.s37",
      "source_sha256": "b039b241eb901f8c",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-07",
      "group_size": 24,
      "text": "The Spirit of the Lord"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.35.s38",
      "source_sha256": "6b17da0fa9f4340c",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-02",
      "group_size": 21,
      "text": "made me, and the breath of the Almighty gave me life.\""
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.35.s39",
      "source_sha256": "6fc2801e9d31a336",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-02",
      "group_size": 21,
      "text": "\"Behold, God himself made me just as he made you.\" Concerning the same one of whom he had indeed said earlier: \"The Spirit of the Lord"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.35.s40",
      "source_sha256": "b1193b4651b5cf49",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-07",
      "group_size": 24,
      "text": "made me."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.35.s41",
      "source_sha256": "e372900aa6c7c4cf",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-07",
      "group_size": 24,
      "text": "This he moreover fastened"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.35.s42",
      "source_sha256": "e2be16a602ffcac2",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-07",
      "group_size": 24,
      "text": "to God"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.35.s43",
      "source_sha256": "0cffbf916e8c8596",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-07",
      "group_size": 24,
      "text": "there."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.35.s44",
      "source_sha256": "3a9b630cceeb8545",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-02",
      "group_size": 21,
      "text": "he"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.35.s45",
      "source_sha256": "06d9e6a55a1647f7",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-07",
      "group_size": 24,
      "text": "After that he said: See, God also made me just as he made you, so that he might make known"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.35.s46",
      "source_sha256": "1056d1d3f16d18e4",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-07",
      "group_size": 24,
